This folder is Radiabase_mobile, an Expo (React Native) app. It is not Next.js and not the API.

The backend is the sibling GitHub repo sunnected_jose (NestJS). Keep git separate. Edit NestJS only in sunnected_jose.

## Stack

- Expo, Expo Router, React Native, TypeScript
- Zustand and TanStack React Query
- React Native StyleSheet and existing UI components (not Tailwind, Shadcn, or RSC)

## Code

- Use English for all code and documentation.
- Declare types for variables, parameters, and return values. Avoid `any`.
- Use camelCase for variables and functions, PascalCase for components.
- Name booleans with verbs: isLoading, hasError, canDelete.
- Prefer functional components. Keep functions short and single-purpose.
- Use early returns instead of nested blocks.
- Colocate screens under `app/`, reusable UI under `components/`, hooks under `hooks/`.

## Git and workspace

- Do not merge this repo with sunnected_jose.
- Do not add git submodules.
- Two folders, two git statuses, two PRs.
